            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "1. Ask the store clerk for a Quick Pick (QP) ticket or fill out a play slip. Pick one (1) to eight (8) teams from the 32 logos in the play area. If you select fewer than eight teams, the terminal will randomly select the remaining team(s) for you. ",
